    <informations>Viri: SolarEdge Three Phase Commercial Inverter For Europe SE20K/SE25K/SE30K/SE33.3K, datasheet DS-000053-EU (17. 6. 2024), velja za SEXXK-RWX0IXXXX - kopija uradnega SolarEdge dokumenta (vir: vpsolar.com) str. 2-3; SolarEdge Installation Guide Three Phase Inverter with SetApp Configuration PN: SEXXK-XXXXIXXXX, For Europe and APAC, Version 1.0 (Dec. 2020) - kopija uradnega SolarEdge dokumenta (vir: memodo.de) str. PDF str. 15 (dolžine, preseki DC), 22-27 (vmesniki), 32 (ozemljitev), 34-38 (AC, DC), 47-60 (komunikacija, RS485, PRI), 64 (SPD), 67 (mere), 72-75 (tehnični podatki SE25K-SE33.3K); SolarEdge Three Phase Inverter For Europe SE12.5K-SE20K, datasheet DS-000040-3.2-EU (07/2021), stolpec SE20K velja za SEXXK-XXXXIBXX4 - kopija uradnega SolarEdge dokumenta (vir: shop.solexis.ch) str. 2; SolarEdge C&amp;I Product Portfolio - Three Phase Commercial Inverter For Europe SE20K...SE40K (SE-SIN-RWR0IBNH8 / SE-SIN-RW00IBNM4, MultiRange) - kopija uradnega SolarEdge dokumenta (vir: shop.krannich-solar.com); uporabljeno le za primerjavo opcij po kodi str. 2-3; Siblik Datenblatt SE25K-RW00IBNM4 (distributer, Stand 31.05.2024) - NI SolarEdge dokument, samo za navzkrižno preverjanje str. 1; ESTG (distributer) - naslovi strani v iskalniku: SE25K-RW00IBNM4 'mc4 with setapp configuration', SE30K-RW00IBNM4 'mc4 dc spd with setapp configuration', SE30K-RW00IBNJ4 'mc4 dc safety unit with switch ac dc spd'; strani zaradi HTTP 429 niso bile odprte str. -
